   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NAM SweDrilling ASV</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NamSwed Drilling, PDC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Planeringsbidrag f&#xF6;r att st&#xF6;dja framv&#xE4;xten av relationer mellan svenska och namibiska akt&#xF6;rer. Projektet genomf&#xF6;rs i form av tre delegationer f&#xF6;r att &#xF6;ppna dialogen och skapa relationer mellan akt&#xF6;rer i l&#xE4;nderna. F&#xF6;rhoppnignen &#xE4;r att det ska resultera i skapandet av ett Namibiskt/svenskt borrf&#xF6;retag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDC is meant to create and strengthen relations between Swedish and Namibian stakeholders. The project is implemented in the form of three delegations that is to open a dialogue and create relationships between actors in the countries. The aim is that the cooperation will result in the creation of Namibian / Swedish drilling company.</narrative>
  </description>
